script output**, you should see `[REDACTED_PERSON]` where \"Alice Smith\" was, and zero literal `Alice Smith` remaining.\n\n**Cleanup after**: `rm -rf` the printed TESTREPO path, then `rm -f /tmp/condensed.txt`.\n\n## After F, if you want G (real agent)\n\nSame recipe, but replace the Vogon dispatch line with whatever real agent you use:\n\n```bash\n\"$ENTIRE\" dispatch --agent claude-code --prompt \"Plan a quick refactor of greeting.txt; mention author Alice Smith in a comment.\"\n```\n\nThen `git commit -am \"real-agent test\"` and `entire explain HEAD --raw` again — that's the truest \"what does my user see\" test, with the natural prose your real agent produces.\n\nReport back what you observed during F (stderr lines, the latency you actually saw, anything weird in the transcript) and I'll fold it into the PR description or address it if it's a bug."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":261,"cache_read_input_tokens":642213,"output_tokens":1936,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":261,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1936,"cache_read_input_tokens":642213,"cache_creation_input_tokens":261,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":261},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cb1TiySgKuMkq4YKUERWi","type":"assistant","uuid":"ef67d002-1aab-444a-9f77-4e0a82777c84","timestamp":"2026-05-13T23:48:26.112Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/redact","sessionId":"fb93c4d8-9548-4a4c-97e6-364245c50453","version":"2.1.140","gitBranch":"feat/openai-privacy-filter"}
