{"parentUuid":"f3cd0485-f4a1-4916-b7b4-842d825130ab","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01RuS4GAcXtpTbCVR8TecyW4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Q1EePv4hxTVkgvB8SW9HNw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add redact/opf_runtime/shellout.go redact/opf_runtime/shellout_test.go redact/opf_progress.go && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(redact): convert OPF char offsets to byte offsets; route progress UX to /dev/tty\n\nTwo bugs surfaced during real-agent smoke testing:\n\n1. OPF returns Python str (rune) offsets, not byte offsets — confirmed\n   by probing the real opf binary with \"Alice Smith ─ Bob Jones\": the\n   \"Bob Jones\" span is reported at rune offsets [14,23], not byte\n   offsets [16,25]. Our code was treating these as byte offsets and\n   slicing through multi-byte UTF-8 sequences, producing garbled '�'s\n   (U+FFFD) in any transcript containing non-ASCII text — visible in\n   Claude Code's '★ Insight ─────' formatting.\n\n   Fix: add charToByteOffset() in shellout.go and translate each\n   span's start/end before partitioning. partitionIndex and the\n   per-input base subtraction already operate on byte offsets, so the\n   downstream code is unchanged.\n\n   Regression test: TestShellOut_RedactBatch_MultiByteUTF8Offsets\n   constructs a span list with known rune offsets and asserts the\n   returned spans are byte-correct AND that the byte offsets actually\n   slice cleanly to the expected text.\n\n2. Progress and failure messages were being silently swallowed by the\n   post-commit git hook Entire installs:\n\n     entire hooks git post-commit 2>/dev/null || true\n\n   The 2>/dev/null is necessary to suppress noise from unrelated\n   logging on the hook path, but it also hid the OPF progress UX —\n   meaning users saw a long pause during commits with zero feedback\n   about what was happening.\n\n   Fix: opfStderr now defaults to /dev/tty when it can be opened\n   (controlling terminal write), falling back to os.Stderr otherwise.\n   /dev/tty bypasses parent-shell redirects, so commit-time OPF\n   progress reaches the user's terminal regardless of how the hook\n   routes stderr. CI / daemon environments without a controlling\n   terminal fall back gracefully (slog still captures the same info\n   in .entire/logs/entire.log).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\" && git log --oneline -3","description":"Commit the two fixes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":758,"cache_read_input_tokens":838143,"output_tokens":938,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":758,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":938,"cache_read_input_tokens":838143,"cache_creation_input_tokens":758,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":758},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cb2siuHCH6yaPwV6zm9va","type":"assistant","uuid":"09a14161-a769-421c-a5ac-0b5bccf58ef0","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:43:35.802Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/redact","sessionId":"fb93c4d8-9548-4a4c-97e6-364245c50453","version":"2.1.140","gitBranch":"feat/openai-privacy-filter"}
